@admin = http://localhost:5100
@inv = http://localhost:5101
@cli = http://localhost:5102
@ven = http://localhost:5103

### Crear tenant uno
POST {{admin}}/api/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantNombre":"AutoSur Tarija","nombre":"Ana","email":"ana@example.com","password":"ClaveDemo123!"}

### Crear tenant dos
POST {{admin}}/api/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantNombre":"Motores del Valle","nombre":"Carlos","email":"carlos@example.com","password":"ClaveDemo123!"}

### Crear plan
POST {{admin}}/api/planes
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Profesional","precio":149,"duracionDias":30,"disponible":true}

### Consultar planes
GET {{admin}}/api/planes/disponibles

### Suscribir usuario 1 al plan 1 (ajustar IDs reales)
POST {{admin}}/api/suscripciones
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuarioId":1,"planId":1}

### Vigencia de usuario 1
GET {{admin}}/api/suscripciones/vigencia/1

### Inventario tenant 1
POST {{inv}}/api/vehiculos
X-Tenant-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"marca":"Toyota","modelo":"Hilux","anio":2020,"precio":120000,"estado":"Disponible"}

### Inventario tenant 2: no debe mostrar inventario tenant 1
GET {{inv}}/api/vehiculos
X-Tenant-Id: 2

### Clientes tenant 1
POST {{cli}}/api/clientes
X-Tenant-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Cliente de prueba","telefono":"70000000","correo":"cliente@example.com"}

### Venta tenant 1 - referencias a recursos propios, sin FK entre microservicios
POST {{ven}}/api/ventas
X-Tenant-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"vehiculoId":1,"clienteId":1,"precioFinal":115000,"estado":"Pendiente"}
